    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The speed $v$ of a liquid leaving a tube depends on the change in pressure $\\Delta P$ and the density $\\rho$ of the liquid. The speed is given by the equation"
    },
    {
      "type": "equation",
      "latex": "v = k\\left(\\dfrac{\\Delta P}{\\rho}\\right)^{n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "where $k$ is a constant that has no units."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "What is the value of $n$?"
    }
  ],
  "layout": "list",
  "options": {
